and Sewer Maintenance for the calendar year 2023was 4.7% and the Wyoming Cost of Living Index-
Southeast Region for the second quarter of 2023 was 4.3%;
WHEREAS, the 2020Board of Public Utilities Water and Wastewater Rate Study recommends
an adjustment of 5.0%forfiscal year 2025 to Connection Fees and simplified System Development Fees
Construction Cost Index"(ENR CCI) which, for calendar year 2023, was 4.2%; and
NOW, THEREFORE, BEIT RESOLVED that the Water and Sewer Connection Fees, Related
Fees rate schedule will be adjusted approximately 10.0%, for Water and 8.0% for Sewer except as
otherwise noted.
